<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/nav') %><main class="container page-pad"><div class="page-intro"><span class="section-kicker">ASSESSMENT MANAGER</span><h1>Bank Soal</h1><p class="muted">Aktif/nonaktif soal, tambah atau ubah pilihan jawaban dan pembahasan.</p></div><%- include('../partials/adminnav') %><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-3 mb-3"><form method="get" action="/admin/questions" class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><label for="moduleFilter" class="small muted">Modul</label><select id="moduleFilter" name="module_id" class="form-select"><option value="">Semua modul</option><% modules.forEach(m=>{ %><option value="<%= m.id %>" <%= Number(selected)===Number(m.id)?'selected':'' %>><%= m.title %></option><% }) %></select><button class="btn btn-outline-dark">Filter</button></form><a href="/admin/questions/new" class="btn btn-brand"><i class="bi bi-plus-lg"></i> Tambah Soal</a></div><div class="panel table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0"><thead><tr><th>Code</th><th>Question</th><th>Submateri</th><th>Level</th><th>Status</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody><% if(!questions.length){ %><tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center py-4">Tidak ada soal.</td></tr><% } %><% questions.forEach(q=>{ %><tr><td><code><%= q.code %></code></td><td class="q-short"><%= q.stem %></td><td><small><%= q.lesson_title||q.module_title %></small></td><td><span class="tag-soft"><%= q.difficulty %></span></td><td><span class="status-pill <%= q.is_active?'published':'' %>"><%= q.is_active?'Active':'Inactive' %></span></td><td><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-dark" href="/admin/questions/<%= q.id %>/edit">Edit</a><form action="/admin/questions/<%= q.id %>/toggle" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" type="submit"><%= q.is_active?'Disable':'Enable' %></button></form></div></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div><p class="muted small mt-3">Maksimal 300 soal tampil per filter pada MVP ini. Soal dinonaktifkan tidak akan muncul dalam sesi baru, tetapi snapshot ujian lama tetap utuh.</p></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
